# Publication source archives — extracted into chapterN_*/paper/, not needed in git
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX build / auxiliary files (regenerated on every compile, incl. Overleaf)
#
# NOTE: *.pdf is deliberately NOT ignored. Figures and the embedded paper PDFs
#       (chapterN_*/paper/_thesis_main.pdf) MUST stay committed so the thesis
#       compiles on Overleaf, which embeds them via \includepaper but never
#       rebuilds them. Only the top-level thesis output PDF is ignored below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.lof
*.log
*.lol
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.toc
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.xdy
*.glo
*.gls
*.glg
*.acn
*.acr
*.alg
*.thm
*.tdo
*.maf
*.mtc*
*.upa
*.upb
*.brf
*.ist
*.fmt
*.pyg

